    {"scene": "hook", "chapter": "開場", "narration": "用 Claude Code 做專案，常常會同時開好幾個 session，你是不是變成了它們之間的傳話筒？", "ms": 4700, "pause": 0},
    {"scene": "pain", "chapter": "痛點", "narration": "每次都得複製貼上，另一個 session 不懂背景，還得重講一次。", "ms": 3800, "pause": 0},
    {"hide": "reel", "pause": 0},
    {"show": "claude", "chapter": "傳訊息並回覆", "narration": "現在只要一句話，Claude 就能傳訊息給另一個 session。", "focus": "claude:composer", "pause": 0},
    {"user": "問一下「price-utils」那個 session，formatPrice 怎麼用", "ms": 1800, "pause": 0},
    {"thinking": true, "ms": 1500, "pause": 0},
    {"narration": "它會連同背景一起，把問題傳給另一個 session，", "tell": "price-utils", "message": "記帳 App 要用 `formatPrice()` 顯示金額，請告訴我參數和回傳格式？", "open": true, "ms": 2600, "pause": 0},
    {"state": "wait", "pause": 0},
    {"narration": "它收到後，直接回覆，", "session": "price-utils", "focus": false, "ms": 1700, "pause": 0},
    {"narration": "答案就回到原本的對話裡，", "tell": "記帳 App", "message": "`formatPrice(amount, { currency, digits })`，回傳字串，例如 `NT$ 10.5`。", "open": true, "ms": 1700, "pause": 0},
    {"state": "ok", "pause": 0},
    {"narration": "完全不用你轉述，也不用重講背景。", "session": "記帳 App", "focus": false, "ms": 2500, "pause": 0},
    {"hide": "claude", "focus": false, "pause": 0},
    {"show": "reel", "pause": 0},
    {"scene": "fetch", "chapter": "取資料", "narration": "這個功能有三種常見用法。第一，取資料：直接問另一個專案，資料規格是什麼。", "ms": 4700, "pause": 0},
    {"scene": "send", "chapter": "回報問題", "narration": "第二，回報問題：用到另一個專案的功能出了狀況，直接傳訊息通知那個 session。", "ms": 4600, "pause": 0},
